Package: neurogeo
Title: Neuroimaging Geoinformatics Core Objects
Version: 6.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(family = "zh1peng",
           email = "zhipeng30@foxmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A reference implementation of the Neuroimaging Geoinformatics
    Core Specification. It represents neuroimaging measurements as aligned
    data layers defined on a shared spatial base. It builds
    and diagnoses sparse support mappings from already-known surface
    registrations, voxel affines, segmentations, and probabilistic atlases.
